  "form_style": "regular",
  "has_parameters": true,
  "help": "<div class=\"section\" id=\"read-10x-genomics-formatted-mtx-directory-read10xcounts\">\n<h1>Read 10x-Genomics-formatted mtx directory (<cite>Read10xCounts()</cite>)</h1>\n<p>The mtx directory should contain:</p>\n<ol class=\"arabic simple\">\n<li>Raw expression quantification as a sparse matrix in Matrix Market format, where the each column is a gene and each row is a barcode/cell.</li>\n<li>A gene table of at least two columns where the first column gives the gene IDs.</li>\n<li>A barcode/cell table of at least one column giving the barcode/cell IDs.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The above-mentioned files can be obtained by running <cite>EBI SCXA Data Retrieval</cite>\nwith a dataset accession.</p>\n<p>&#64;HELP&#64;</p>\n</div>\n",
  "help_format": "restructuredtext",
